Fix Delivery History clipboard-copy failing over plain HTTP (v0.106)

navigator.clipboard only exists in a secure context (HTTPS or
localhost), so it was undefined on the LAN-IP-over-HTTP address this app
is normally reached at - the copy buttons added in v0.105 threw
"blocking clipboard access" for everyone, not a browser setting issue.
copyToClipboard() now falls back to document.execCommand("copy") via a
hidden off-screen textarea when navigator.clipboard/isSecureContext
isn't available - same class of gotcha as the existing
crypto.randomUUID() workaround already noted elsewhere in OrderEdit.tsx.

